Short:        two _fast_ chunky2planar converters
Type:         dev/src
Architecture: m68k-amigaos
Authors:      James McCoull, Peter McGavin (peterm@maths.grace.cri.nz) Conrad Sanderson (g.sanderson@ais.gu.edu.au)

Long:

8 bitplane c2p converters, one using the CPU with the blitter and the
second one using the CPU only.  Comes with examples of implementation.


